  dialogueNodes:
  - id: Start
    text: 'Have you ever noticed your <sprite name="mr"> is also valid? If not, don''t
      worry. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 1
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 1
    text: 'I will teach you how to use the defense ability. Remember the defense
      ability is bound to the weapon type. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 2
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 2
    text: 'when you equip a gun and in the state of moving, press <sprite name=mr>
      can let you dash on the original direction. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 3
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 3
    text: 'It''s noticable you will turn gray and enter invincible state for a little
      while. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 4
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 4
    text: 'That will be quite useful if you are enclosed by bullet hell. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 5
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 5
    text: 'Next, Press <sprite name="1"> to requip pistol and try several times in
      place.  '
    nextNodeIds:
    - 6
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
  - id: 6
    text: 'Once you are ready, come close to me and I have a task for you. '
    nextNodeIds:
    - null
    choiceText: []
    choiceEventKeys: []
